# ----- GMAIL ACCOUNT ---------------------------------------------------------
IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
UserCmd "bw get username 'Gmail Apps' --session $BW_SESSION"
PassCmd "bw get password 'Gmail Apps' --session $BW_SESSION"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
PipelineDepth 1

# ----- REMOTE STORE -----
IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

# ----- LOCAL STORE -----
MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/Mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/gmail/Inbox
SubFolders Verbatim

# ----- CHANNEL CONFIGURATION -----
Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
ExpireUnread no
MaxMessages 2000

